en: '<p class="l-text"><strong>Welcome to the summit of Python Core.</strong> You have mastered the fundamentals — variables, control flow, data structures, functions, OOP. Now we push into territory that separates hobbyists from professionals: <strong>generators</strong> for memory-efficient data processing, <strong>regular expressions</strong> for pattern matching in NLP pipelines, <strong>functional programming</strong> tools, <strong>type hints</strong> for maintainable codebases, <strong>concurrency</strong> for real-world performance, and <strong>best practices</strong> that define the professional Python workflow.</p>'

